Rips_DeletePreset
├── when the caller is not the owner
│   └── it should revert.
└── when the caller is the owner
    ├── when the preset does not exist
    │   └── it should revert.
    ├── when the preset is already deleted
    │   └── it should revert.
    └── when the preset is not deleted
        ├── it should mark the preset as deleted.
        └── it should emit a {PresetDeleted} event.
